How ChatGPT now uses it
The render brief tells it:
1. Find the essay's theme in the PIL index
2. Search the gold corpus for similar content
3. Open the closest PIL file — see how we performed the same concept before
4. Borrow the craft (continuity object, palette, motion) — never the content
This fixes the gap: ChatGPT now has the actual gold-standard films to reference, and a way to find the one closest to its current essay. The craft-reference loop is complete — it searches the proven corpus, learns how we did similar work, then derives fresh visuals for the new essa

